width=400
height=124
xmode=abs_centre
ymode=abs_centre
layer=com_9
textfont=tutorial_font
text=Now, drag the weight you believe to be the heavy one onto the backpack icon that's appeared in the top-left corner to take it into your inventory. Place the weight on the diamond display at the back of the vault to see if you got the correct one.
textlineheight=16
colour=0x2a1a08

[com_6]
type=text
y=110
width=400
height=124
xmode=abs_centre
ymode=abs_centre
layer=com_9
textfont=tutorial_font
text=Alternatively, if you don't think you have the correct weight, you can reset the puzzle by using the scales again after taking a weight, or by right-clicking on the scales.
textlineheight=16
colour=0x2a1a08

