[com_132]
type=text
x=-27
y=-42
width=336
height=124
xmode=abs_centre
ymode=abs_centre
layer=com_8
textfont=tutorial_font
text=On the plinths in front of the scales are nine identical-looking weights. Eight of them weigh the same, but one is heavier than the rest.<br><br>Up to three weights can be placed on either side of the scales by dragging and dropping them.<br><br>The symbols on the weights are an aid, not a clue.
textlineheight=12
colour=0x2a1a08

[com_133]
type=text
x=35
y=75
width=336
height=96
xmode=abs_centre
ymode=abs_centre
layer=com_8
textfont=tutorial_font
text=Once you've placed weights on the scales, press the diamond-shaped button on Het's chest to perform a weighing. After you have performed two weighings, the scales will lock up.
textlineheight=12
colour=0x2a1a08

